WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Blocked Drive Impact splats Ryu beside the corner.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.800
Crouching heavy punch begins the wall-splat juggle.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.600
OD Adamant Flame connects after the crouching heavy punch.

4
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.850
The forward-punch follow-up lifts Ryu.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.700
Heavy Tatsu catches the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.100
Ryu recovers at the end of the OD Flame route.
